<para>
  Copy the <link
  linkname="Section-Concepts-Mesh-Solvers">solvers</link> from the
  &subproblems; in one &mesh; to the identically named &subproblems;
  in another.  To copy a single solver, see <xref
  linkend="MenuItem-OOF.Subproblem.Copy_Solver"/>.
</para>
<para>
  In the GUI, this command is invoked by the <link
  linkend="Section-Tasks-Solver-SolverPane-CopyAll"><guibutton>Copy
  All</guibutton></link> button in the <link
  linkend="Section-Tasks-Solver-SolverPane"><guilabel>Solver</guilabel></link>
  pane in the <link linkend="Section-Tasks-Solver">Solver</link> page.
</para>

